  "scope": "Literal row-31 sampler-result validity and row-27 gamma nonzero plumbing for the selected all-byte sampler model. QuerySample shows that a successful `.ok` query result decodes through the strict positional query reader. OpeningRunGood derives the existing Good predicate from successful terminal reading and its stated no-hit condition, with nonzero gamma obtained from the sampler. These are model-level results; they do not establish accepted-reader coverage, D3, Rust source correspondence, or a complete security claim.",
